## Key Configuration Files

| File | Purpose |
|---|---|
| `wrangler.jsonc` | Cloudflare Pages config, D1 bindings, compatibility flags |
| `vite.config.ts` | Vite build config with `@hono/vite-cloudflare-pages` plugin |
| `ecosystem.config.cjs` | PM2 process manager config for local dev |
| `tsconfig.json` | TypeScript config |
| `.dev.vars` | Local development environment variables (secrets) |
| `package.json` | Dependencies and npm scripts |

